  npcName: Maria
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 6120914730915384989, guid: 321acedcdc593f449b63b40bbde51ee0, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Right, now off to the market...
  - "It is. Fresh beef, sour cream\u2026 nothing better."
  - My children could eat borscht several times a week.
  - "And I\u2019m only happy to make it for them."
  - "Without meat? That\u2019s unusual\u2026"
  - But everyone has their own way, I suppose.
  - Go left, toward the central square.
  - Nothing beats a warm meal.
